          "code": "import math\nfrom itertools import combinations\nimport numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\n\n# Model non-linier 5 fitur: interaksi (X0*X1), simetri eksak (X2 & X3 identik), dan fitur Dummy (X4)\ndef model_f(X: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    return 1.5 * X[:, 0] + 1.0 * X[:, 1] + 2.0 * X[:, 0] * X[:, 1] + 0.8 * X[:, 2] + 0.8 * X[:, 3] + 0.0 * X[:, 4]\n\nd = 5\nX_bg = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(200, d))\n# Pusatkan X_bg ke mean persis 0 agar X2 dan X3 memiliki distribusi marginal simetris untuk uji aksioma Symmetry\nX_bg = X_bg - X_bg.mean(axis=0)\nx_obs = np.array([1.2, 0.8, 0.5, 0.5, 2.5])\n\ndef v_interventional(S: tuple[int, ...]) -> float:\n    X_eval = X_bg.copy()\n    for j in S:\n        X_eval[:, j] = x_obs[j]\n    return float(np.mean(model_f(X_eval)))\n\n# 1. Exact Interventional Shapley Value: enumerasi seluruh 2^d = 32 subset\nv_cache = {}\nfor r in range(d + 1):\n    for S in combinations(range(d), r):\n        v_cache[S] = v_interventional(S)\n\nphi_exact = np.zeros(d)\nfor j in range(d):\n    others = [k for k in range(d) if k != j]\n    for r in range(d):\n        w = math.factorial(r) * math.factorial(d - r - 1) / math.factorial(d)\n        for S in combinations(others, r):\n            S_plus = tuple(sorted(S + (j,)))\n            phi_exact[j] += w * (v_cache[S_plus] - v_cache[S])\n\nphi0 = v_cache[()]\nfx = float(model_f(x_obs.reshape(1, -1))[0])\n\n# 2. Weighted-OLS KernelSHAP (Lundberg & Lee 2017) dengan kendala Efficiency eksak\ncoalitions = [S for r in range(1, d) for S in combinations(range(d), r)]\nZ = np.zeros((len(coalitions), d))\nweights = np.zeros(len(coalitions))\ny_val = np.zeros(len(coalitions))\nfor idx, S in enumerate(coalitions):\n    s_len = len(S)\n    Z[idx, list(S)] = 1.0\n    weights[idx] = (d - 1.0) / (math.comb(d, s_len) * s_len * (d - s_len))\n    y_val[idx] = v_cache[S] - phi0\n\ntotal_diff = fx - phi0\nA_wls = Z[:, :-1] - Z[:, [-1]]\nb_wls = y_val - Z[:, -1] * total_diff\nW_mat = np.diag(weights)\nphi_k_sub = np.linalg.solve(A_wls.T @ W_mat @ A_wls, A_wls.T @ W_mat @ b_wls)\nphi_kernel_exact = np.append(phi_k_sub, total_diff - np.sum(phi_k_sub))\n\n# 3. Verifikasi 4 Aksioma Unik Shapley\ndef model_g(X: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    return -0.5 * X[:, 0] + 1.2 * X[:, 2]\n\ndef exact_shap_fn(fn):\n    vc = {}\n    for r in range(d + 1):\n        for S in combinations(range(d), r):\n            Xe = X_bg.copy()\n            for j in S:\n                Xe[:, j] = x_obs[j]\n            vc[S] = float(np.mean(fn(Xe)))\n    out = np.zeros(d)\n    for j in range(d):\n        others = [k for k in range(d) if k != j]\n        for r in range(d):\n            w = math.factorial(r) * math.factorial(d - r - 1) / math.factorial(d)\n            for S in combinations(others, r):\n                out[j] += w * (vc[tuple(sorted(S + (j,)))] - vc[S])\n    return out\n\nphi_g = exact_shap_fn(model_g)\nphi_fg = exact_shap_fn(lambda X: model_f(X) + model_g(X))\n\nprint(f\"Baseline E[f(X)] = {phi0:.4f} | Prediksi f(x) = {fx:.4f} | Selisih = {total_diff:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Exact Shapley    : {np.round(phi_exact, 5).tolist()}\")\nprint(f\"KernelSHAP (WLS) : {np.round(phi_kernel_exact, 5).tolist()}\")\nprint(f\"Max |Exact - KernelSHAP Full| = {np.max(np.abs(phi_exact - phi_kernel_exact)):.2e}\")\nprint(\"--- Verifikasi Empat Aksioma Unik Shapley ---\")\nprint(f\"  1. Efficiency : phi0 + sum(phi) = {phi0 + np.sum(phi_exact):.6f} vs f(x) = {fx:.6f} (err={abs(phi0 + np.sum(phi_exact) - fx):.2e})\")\nprint(f\"  2. Symmetry   : |phi_2 - phi_3| = {abs(phi_exact[2] - phi_exact[3]):.2e} (phi_2={phi_exact[2]:.5f}, phi_3={phi_exact[3]:.5f})\")\nprint(f\"  3. Dummy      : |phi_4|         = {abs(phi_exact[4]):.2e} (meski x_4 = 2.5!)\")\nprint(f\"  4. Additivity : max |phi(f+g) - (phi(f)+phi(g))| = {np.max(np.abs(phi_fg - (phi_exact + phi_g))):.2e}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "Baseline E[f(X)] = 0.2122 | Prediksi f(x) = 5.3200 | Selisih = 5.1078\nExact Shapley    : [2.6539, 1.6539, 0.4, 0.4, 0.0]\nKernelSHAP (WLS) : [2.6539, 1.6539, 0.4, 0.4, -0.0]\nMax |Exact - KernelSHAP Full| = 8.88e-16\n--- Verifikasi Empat Aksioma Unik Shapley ---\n  1. Efficiency : phi0 + sum(phi) = 5.320000 vs f(x) = 5.320000 (err=8.88e-16)\n  2. Symmetry   : |phi_2 - phi_3| = 0.00e+00 (phi_2=0.40000, phi_3=0.40000)\n  3. Dummy      : |phi_4|         = 0.00e+00 (meski x_4 = 2.5!)\n  4. Additivity : max |phi(f+g) - (phi(f)+phi(g))| = 4.44e-16",
          "actualOutput": "Baseline E[f(X)] = 0.2122 | Prediksi f(x) = 5.3200 | Selisih = 5.1078\nExact Shapley    : [2.6539, 1.6539, 0.4, 0.4, 0.0]\nKernelSHAP (WLS) : [2.6539, 1.6539, 0.4, 0.4, -0.0]\nMax |Exact - KernelSHAP Full| = 8.88e-16\n--- Verifikasi Empat Aksioma Unik Shapley ---\n  1. Efficiency : phi0 + sum(phi) = 5.320000 vs f(x) = 5.320000 (err=8.88e-16)\n  2. Symmetry   : |phi_2 - phi_3| = 0.00e+00 (phi_2=0.40000, phi_3=0.40000)\n  3. Dummy      : |phi_4|         = 0.00e+00 (meski x_4 = 2.5!)\n  4. Additivity : max |phi(f+g) - (phi(f)+phi(g))| = 4.44e-16",
