          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef solve_actionable_recourse_kkt(w, b, x, mad, mutable_mask, target_prob=0.60) -> tuple[list[float], float, float, float]:\n    w = np.asarray(w, dtype=float)\n    x = np.asarray(x, dtype=float)\n    mad = np.asarray(mad, dtype=float)\n    mask = np.asarray(mutable_mask, dtype=bool)\n    target_logit = float(np.log(target_prob / (1.0 - target_prob)))\n    cur_logit = float(np.dot(w, x) + b)\n    gap = max(0.0, target_logit - cur_logit)\n    w_m = w[mask]\n    m2 = mad[mask] ** 2\n    delta_m = gap * (w_m * m2) / float(np.sum((w_m ** 2) * m2))\n    x_cf = x.copy()\n    x_cf[mask] += delta_m\n    new_p = float(1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(np.dot(w, x_cf) + b))))\n    l1_mad = float(np.sum(np.abs(x_cf - x) / mad))\n    immut_viol = float(np.max(np.abs(x_cf[~mask] - x[~mask]))) if np.any(~mask) else 0.0\n    return ([round(float(v), 4) for v in x_cf], round(new_p, 4), round(l1_mad, 4), round(immut_viol, 6))\n```"
