          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\n\n# Verifikasi Eksak Teorema Impossibility Kleinberg-Mullainathan-Raghavan (2016) & Chouldechova (2017)\n# Dua kelompok demografi A=0 (base rate p0 = 0.45) dan A=1 (base rate p1 = 0.20)\n# Skor risiko S terkalibrasi SEMPURNA di kedua kelompok: P(Y=1 | S=s, A=a) == s !\nn_g = 20000\nS0 = rng.beta(2.25, 2.75, size=n_g)  # E[S0] = 0.45\nS1 = rng.beta(1.00, 4.00, size=n_g)  # E[S1] = 0.20\nY0 = rng.binomial(1, S0)\nY1 = rng.binomial(1, S1)\n\ndef group_metrics(y_true, scores, thresh):\n    y_hat = (scores >= thresh).astype(int)\n    pos = y_true == 1\n    neg = y_true == 0\n    tpr = float(np.mean(y_hat[pos]))\n    fpr = float(np.mean(y_hat[neg]))\n    fnr = 1.0 - tpr\n    ppv = float(np.mean(y_true[y_hat == 1])) if np.any(y_hat == 1) else 0.0\n    p_rate = float(np.mean(y_true))\n    sel_rate = float(np.mean(y_hat))\n    mu1 = float(np.mean(scores[pos]))\n    mu0 = float(np.mean(scores[neg]))\n    bins = np.linspace(0.0, 1.0, 6)\n    ece = 0.0\n    for k in range(5):\n        m = (scores >= bins[k]) & (scores < bins[k + 1])\n        if np.any(m):\n            ece += float(np.mean(m)) * abs(float(np.mean(y_true[m])) - float(np.mean(scores[m])))\n    return dict(p=p_rate, sel=sel_rate, tpr=tpr, fpr=fpr, fnr=fnr, ppv=ppv, mu1=mu1, mu0=mu0, ece=ece)\n\nm0_cal = group_metrics(Y0, S0, 0.50)\nm1_cal = group_metrics(Y1, S1, 0.50)\n\n# Verifikasi Eksak Identitas Chouldechova (2017): FPR = (p/(1-p)) * ((1-PPV)/PPV) * (1-FNR)\nfpr0_chould = (m0_cal[\"p\"] / (1.0 - m0_cal[\"p\"])) * ((1.0 - m0_cal[\"ppv\"]) / m0_cal[\"ppv\"]) * (1.0 - m0_cal[\"fnr\"])\nfpr1_chould = (m1_cal[\"p\"] / (1.0 - m1_cal[\"p\"])) * ((1.0 - m1_cal[\"ppv\"]) / m1_cal[\"ppv\"]) * (1.0 - m1_cal[\"fnr\"])\n\n# Memaksa Equal Opportunity (TPR1 == TPR0) dengan menurunkan ambang Group 1\ngrid_t = np.linspace(0.05, 0.90, 851)\nt1_eq_tpr = float(grid_t[np.argmin([abs(np.mean((S1[Y1 == 1] >= t)) - m0_cal[\"tpr\"]) for t in grid_t])])\nm1_eq = group_metrics(Y1, S1, t1_eq_tpr)\n\nprint(\"=== VERIFIKASI TEOREMA IMPOSSIBILITY KLEINBERG (2016) & CHOULDECHOVA (2017) ===\")\nprint(f\"Base Rate Populasi    : p0 = {m0_cal['p']:.4f} vs p1 = {m1_cal['p']:.4f} (berbeda!)\")\nprint(\"--- 1. Skor Terkalibrasi Sempurna (ECE ~ 0) -> Balance Pos/Neg PASTI DILANGGAR ---\")\nprint(f\"  Group 0 (ECE={m0_cal['ece']:.4f}): E[S|Y=1]={m0_cal['mu1']:.4f} | E[S|Y=0]={m0_cal['mu0']:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"  Group 1 (ECE={m1_cal['ece']:.4f}): E[S|Y=1]={m1_cal['mu1']:.4f} | E[S|Y=0]={m1_cal['mu0']:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"  Gap Kleinberg         : |Delta E[S|Y=1]|={abs(m0_cal['mu1']-m1_cal['mu1']):.4f} | |Delta E[S|Y=0]|={abs(m0_cal['mu0']-m1_cal['mu0']):.4f}\")\nprint(\"--- 2. Ambang Global tau=0.50 -> Verifikasi Identitas Chouldechova 6-Desimal ---\")\nprint(f\"  Group 0: TPR={m0_cal['tpr']:.4f} | FPR={m0_cal['fpr']:.6f} (Chouldechova={fpr0_chould:.6f}) | PPV={m0_cal['ppv']:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"  Group 1: TPR={m1_cal['tpr']:.4f} | FPR={m1_cal['fpr']:.6f} (Chouldechova={fpr1_chould:.6f}) | PPV={m1_cal['ppv']:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"--- 3. Memaksa Equal Opportunity (t0=0.50, t1={t1_eq_tpr:.3f}) -> PPV/Sufficiency Pecah! ---\")\nprint(f\"  TPR0={m0_cal['tpr']:.4f} vs TPR1={m1_eq['tpr']:.4f} (Gap={abs(m0_cal['tpr']-m1_eq['tpr']):.4f})\")\nprint(f\"  FPR0={m0_cal['fpr']:.4f} vs FPR1={m1_eq['fpr']:.4f} | PPV0={m0_cal['ppv']:.4f} vs PPV1={m1_eq['ppv']:.4f} (Gap PPV={abs(m0_cal['ppv']-m1_eq['ppv']):.4f}!)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== VERIFIKASI TEOREMA IMPOSSIBILITY KLEINBERG (2016) & CHOULDECHOVA (2017) ===\nBase Rate Populasi    : p0 = 0.4460 vs p1 = 0.1985 (berbeda!)\n--- 1. Skor Terkalibrasi Sempurna (ECE ~ 0) -> Balance Pos/Neg PASTI DILANGGAR ---\n  Group 0 (ECE=0.0053): E[S|Y=1]=0.5392 | E[S|Y=0]=0.3752\n  Group 1 (ECE=0.0044): E[S|Y=1]=0.3319 | E[S|Y=0]=0.1667\n  Gap Kleinberg         : |Delta E[S|Y=1]|=0.2073 | |Delta E[S|Y=0]|=0.2085\n--- 2. Ambang Global tau=0.50 -> Verifikasi Identitas Chouldechova 6-Desimal ---\n  Group 0: TPR=0.5806 | FPR=0.254129 (Chouldechova=0.254129) | PPV=0.6477\n  Group 1: TPR=0.1902 | FPR=0.031004 (Chouldechova=0.031004) | PPV=0.6030\n--- 3. Memaksa Equal Opportunity (t0=0.50, t1=0.272) -> PPV/Sufficiency Pecah! ---\n  TPR0=0.5806 vs TPR1=0.5804 (Gap=0.0002)\n  FPR0=0.2541 vs FPR1=0.2036 | PPV0=0.6477 vs PPV1=0.4138 (Gap PPV=0.2339!)",
