          "filename": "33_4_sklearn_ftu_vs_hardt_postprocessing.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingClassifier\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nn = 4000\n\n# Simulasi Kredit / Rekrutmen dengan Proxy Variables kuat terhadap atribut sensitif A in {0, 1}\nA = rng.binomial(1, 0.45, size=n)\nskill = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\nexp_yr = np.clip(5.0 + 1.4 * skill + rng.normal(0.0, 1.1, size=n), 0.0, 20.0)\n# Proxy variables berkorelasi sangat kuat dengan A (kode pos & jeda karier)\nproxy_zip = -1.7 * A + rng.normal(0.0, 0.50, size=n)\nproxy_gap = 1.6 * A + rng.normal(0.0, 0.55, size=n)\n\n# Label pelatihan historis tercemar bias manusia (-1.35 * A); target aktual evaluasi adil (y_true)\np_hist = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(1.7 * skill + 0.25 * (exp_yr - 5.0) - 1.35 * A + 0.25)))\np_true = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(1.7 * skill + 0.25 * (exp_yr - 5.0) - 0.15 * A + 0.10)))\ny_hist = rng.binomial(1, p_hist)\ny_true = rng.binomial(1, p_true)\n\n# FAIRNESS THROUGH UNAWARENESS (FTU): Hapus kolom A dari X, tapi proxy_zip & proxy_gap tetap ada!\nX_no_A = np.column_stack([skill, exp_yr, proxy_zip, proxy_gap])\n\n# Split 3-arah ketat: Train (50%, label historis) / Audit-Val (25%, label teraudit) / Holdout Test (25%)\nidx = np.arange(n)\ntr_idx, tmp_idx = train_test_split(idx, test_size=0.50, stratify=A, random_state=42)\nva_idx, te_idx = train_test_split(tmp_idx, test_size=0.50, stratify=A[tmp_idx], random_state=42)\n\nclf = HistGradientBoostingClassifier(max_depth=4, max_iter=70, min_samples_leaf=25, random_state=42)\nclf.fit(X_no_A[tr_idx], y_hist[tr_idx])\n\np_va = clf.predict_proba(X_no_A[va_idx])[:, 1]\np_te = clf.predict_proba(X_no_A[te_idx])[:, 1]\ny_va, A_va = y_true[va_idx], A[va_idx]\ny_te, A_te = y_true[te_idx], A[te_idx]\n\ndef eval_fairness(y_t, y_pred, g):\n    m0, m1 = (g == 0), (g == 1)\n    sr0, sr1 = float(np.mean(y_pred[m0])), float(np.mean(y_pred[m1]))\n    dir_ratio = sr1 / max(sr0, 1e-9)\n    tpr0 = float(np.mean(y_pred[m0 & (y_t == 1)]))\n    tpr1 = float(np.mean(y_pred[m1 & (y_t == 1)]))\n    fpr0 = float(np.mean(y_pred[m0 & (y_t == 0)]))\n    fpr1 = float(np.mean(y_pred[m1 & (y_t == 0)]))\n    acc = float(np.mean(y_pred == y_t))\n    eod_gap = max(abs(tpr0 - tpr1), abs(fpr0 - fpr1))\n    return dict(acc=acc, dir=dir_ratio, tpr0=tpr0, tpr1=tpr1, fpr0=fpr0, fpr1=fpr1, eod=eod_gap)\n\nbase_res = eval_fairness(y_te, (p_te >= 0.50).astype(int), A_te)\n\n# Hardt et al. (2016) Post-Processing Group Threshold Optimization di Validation Set (Tervektorisasi NumPy!)\ngrid = np.linspace(0.15, 0.85, 71)\nm0_va, m1_va = (A_va == 0), (A_va == 1)\np0_va, y0_va = p_va[m0_va], y_va[m0_va]\np1_va, y1_va = p_va[m1_va], y_va[m1_va]\n\npred0_g = (p0_va[None, :] >= grid[:, None]).astype(int)\npred1_g = (p1_va[None, :] >= grid[:, None]).astype(int)\n\ntpr0_g = pred0_g[:, y0_va == 1].mean(axis=1)\nfpr0_g = pred0_g[:, y0_va == 0].mean(axis=1)\nacc0_cnt = (pred0_g == y0_va[None, :]).sum(axis=1)\n\ntpr1_g = pred1_g[:, y1_va == 1].mean(axis=1)\nfpr1_g = pred1_g[:, y1_va == 0].mean(axis=1)\nacc1_cnt = (pred1_g == y1_va[None, :]).sum(axis=1)\n\neod_mat = np.maximum(np.abs(tpr0_g[:, None] - tpr1_g[None, :]), np.abs(fpr0_g[:, None] - fpr1_g[None, :]))\nacc_mat = (acc0_cnt[:, None] + acc1_cnt[None, :]) / len(y_va)\nscore_mat = np.where(eod_mat <= 0.03, acc_mat - 0.5 * eod_mat, -1e9)\ni0_opt, i1_opt = np.unravel_index(int(np.argmax(score_mat)), score_mat.shape)\nt0_opt, t1_opt = float(grid[i0_opt]), float(grid[i1_opt])\n\npost_pred_te = np.where(A_te == 0, p_te >= t0_opt, p_te >= t1_opt).astype(int)\npost_res = eval_fairness(y_te, post_pred_te, A_te)\n\nprint(\"=== PERBANDINGAN FAIRNESS THROUGH UNAWARENESS VS HARDT (2016) POST-PROCESSING ===\")\nprint(\n    f\"1. FTU Baseline (tau=0.50)   : Acc={base_res['acc']:.4f} | DIR={base_res['dir']:.3f} (<0.80 FAIL!) | \"\n    f\"TPR=({base_res['tpr0']:.3f},{base_res['tpr1']:.3f}) | FPR=({base_res['fpr0']:.3f},{base_res['fpr1']:.3f}) | EOD Gap={base_res['eod']:.3f}\"\n)\nprint(\n    f\"2. Hardt Post-Proc ({t0_opt:.2f},{t1_opt:.2f}): Acc={post_res['acc']:.4f} | DIR={post_res['dir']:.3f} (>=0.80 PASS) | \"\n    f\"TPR=({post_res['tpr0']:.3f},{post_res['tpr1']:.3f}) | FPR=({post_res['fpr0']:.3f},{post_res['fpr1']:.3f}) | EOD Gap={post_res['eod']:.3f}\"\n)\nprint(\n    f\"Ringkasan Trade-Off (Test)   : Delta Acc = {post_res['acc'] - base_res['acc']:+.4f} | \"\n    f\"EOD Gap Turun = {base_res['eod']:.3f} -> {post_res['eod']:.3f} ({100*(1 - post_res['eod']/base_res['eod']):.1f}% reduksi!)\"\n)",
          "expectedOutput": "=== PERBANDINGAN FAIRNESS THROUGH UNAWARENESS VS HARDT (2016) POST-PROCESSING ===\n1. FTU Baseline (tau=0.50)   : Acc=0.7750 | DIR=0.586 (<0.80 FAIL!) | TPR=(0.787,0.574) | FPR=(0.217,0.098) | EOD Gap=0.214\n2. Hardt Post-Proc (0.63,0.33): Acc=0.7740 | DIR=0.922 (>=0.80 PASS) | TPR=(0.676,0.689) | FPR=(0.131,0.152) | EOD Gap=0.021\nRingkasan Trade-Off (Test)   : Delta Acc = -0.0010 | EOD Gap Turun = 0.214 -> 0.021 (90.1% reduksi!)",
          "actualOutput": "=== PERBANDINGAN FAIRNESS THROUGH UNAWARENESS VS HARDT (2016) POST-PROCESSING ===\n1. FTU Baseline (tau=0.50)   : Acc=0.7750 | DIR=0.586 (<0.80 FAIL!) | TPR=(0.787,0.574) | FPR=(0.217,0.098) | EOD Gap=0.214\n2. Hardt Post-Proc (0.63,0.33): Acc=0.7740 | DIR=0.922 (>=0.80 PASS) | TPR=(0.676,0.689) | FPR=(0.131,0.152) | EOD Gap=0.021\nRingkasan Trade-Off (Test)   : Delta Acc = -0.0010 | EOD Gap Turun = 0.214 -> 0.021 (90.1% reduksi!)",
          "explanation": "Melatih HistGBDT tanpa kolom sensitif namun memiliki fitur proksi (proxy_zip, proxy_gap): baseline FTU gagal berat (DIR=0.586 < 0.80, EOD Gap=0.214), sementara Hardt et al. (2016) Post-Processing Group Thresholds (0.63, 0.33) di validation fold memangkas EOD Gap di holdout test sebesar 90.1% (ke 0.021) dan memulihkan DIR ke 0.922 dengan Delta Acc hanya -0.0010.",
